# Pack-shipped TS/Node ignore patterns (2026-05-19 dual-vendor restructure)
#
# Tells Claude Code which paths to exclude from agentic search / file suggestions.
# Codex-side equivalent: [permissions.default.filesystem] entries in .codex/config.toml
# These two files are NOT mirrored by /sync-vendor-files (different formats).
#
# Reference: Anthropic Applied AI team's large-codebases best-practices post (May 14 2026).
# Operator-leverage: Claude burns context opening generated files; exclusion is free leverage.

# === Dependencies ===
node_modules/

# === Build artifacts ===
.next/
.vercel/
dist/
build/
out/
.turbo/
.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo

# === Test coverage ===
coverage/

# === Lockfiles (Claude rarely needs to grep these) ===
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# === Logs ===
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# === Environment / secrets ===
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# === OS metadata ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
